@startuml "Nettoyage post-événement"

title Processus automatique de nettoyage et archivage post-événement

participant "Scheduler\n(Cron Job)" as Scheduler
participant "Cleanup Service" as CleanupSvc
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Archive Storage" as Archive

== Nettoyage post-événement ==
note over Scheduler: Tâche automatique après 24h

Scheduler -> CleanupSvc: startPostEventCleanup(eventId)

== Nettoyage du cache ==
CleanupSvc -> Redis: Clean event cache
Redis -> Redis: DEL event:{eventId}:*
Redis -> Redis: DEL ticket:*:validation_cache (for this event)
Redis -> Redis: DEL used_ticket:{ticketId} (for this event)
Redis --> CleanupSvc: cache cleaned

== Archivage des données ==
CleanupSvc -> DB: Archive old validation data
DB -> Archive: MOVE old ticket_validations TO archive_table
DB -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET archived=true WHERE eventId=?
DB -> DB: UPDATE events SET data_archived=true WHERE id=?
DB --> CleanupSvc: data archived

== Nettoyage des fichiers temporaires ==
CleanupSvc -> CleanupSvc: Clean temporary QR codes
CleanupSvc -> CleanupSvc: Clean session data
CleanupSvc -> CleanupSvc: Clean old logs

CleanupSvc --> Scheduler: cleanup completed

note over Archive: Les données archivées incluent :\n• Historique des validations\n• Logs de sécurité\n• Métriques détaillées\n• Rapports générés\nConservation : 7 ans minimum

@enduml